# (IB) campaigns only

Never create, pause, resume, kill, edit, or change budget on a Meta campaign whose name does **not** contain `(IB)`.

Those are someone else's (e.g. `(J) V LN`). Read-only stats are fine. Writes are not.

```
✅ (IB) LNV 3 X4259
✅ (IB) LNV AF 8-15
❌ (J) V LN
❌ anything without (IB)
```

If asked to "turn off the losers" or similar, filter to `(IB)` names first. Factory-created campaigns already use `(IB)` — keep it that way.
